<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA A BY THREE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA A BY THREE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Australia A by three wickets in their limited-overs cricket tour match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia A 292 for seven in 50 overs (Stuart Law 76, Darren Lehmann 69); Pakistan 293 for seven in 49.5 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 123).</p>
